{"id":"56914510091eed27","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md","title":"ZFC Kappa Complete Filter","display":"df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter — ZFC Kappa Complete Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter","58-df-zfc-filter6-kappa-complete-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter — ZFC Kappa Complete Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-proper-filter]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-kappa-complete-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter — ZFC Kappa Complete Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1590a03f63f7fb6f\" href=\"?note=1590a03f63f7fb6f\" title=\"58-df-proper-filter\">58-df-proper-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,X,\\kappa\\in V,\\quad F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(F,X,\\kappa\\in V,\\quad F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperFilter}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperFilter}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperFilter}(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\neq0\\land\\forall\\delta\\;\\left(0&lt;\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall A\\in F^\\delta\\;\\left(\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\in F\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperFilter}(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\neq0\\land\\forall\\delta\\;\\left(0&lt;\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall A\\in F^\\delta\\;\\left(\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(A)\\in F\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Intersections are taken over nonempty sequences of length below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the empty-family case is already supplied by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in F\">\\(X\\in F\\)</span> in the proper-filter axiom.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter6-kappa-complete-filter</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","